<===> README.md
Members from modules loaded by `load` are not avaialable in the loading module.

<===>
================================================================================
<===> global/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
$_: meta.load("other");
a {b: $c}

<===> global/_other.scss
$c: d;

<===> global/error
Error: Undefined variable.
  ,
3 | a {b: $c}
  |       ^^
  '
  input.scss 3:7  root stylesheet

<===>
================================================================================
<===> namespace/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
$_: meta.load("other");
a {b: other.$c}

<===> namespace/_other.scss
$c: d;

<===> namespace/error
Error: There is no module with namespace "other".
  ,
3 | a {b: other.$c}
  |       ^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 3:7  root stylesheet
